going on out there?

778
00:52:08.752 --> 00:52:10.921
(male #1) 'Creatures.
Like nothing I've ever seen!'

779
00:52:10.987 --> 00:52:13.757
'Moving up out of the mine!
Heading for town! They..'

780
00:52:13.824 --> 00:52:15.025
